WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Twelve minutes is easy to measure. The meaning of that time is harder.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Zen12 describes a short audio routine and four sound styles.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Format is not proof of an hour of meditation.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Studies of binaural beats show mixed EEG findings, and do not test Zen12 itself.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Before you buy, try three free twelve-minute formats and notice what you prefer.

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Read the evidence. Check the terms. Choose without a guarantee.
